[
    {
        "text": "7:55 A.M. \\ Overcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island Cabin #7, Lok Tai Chau, Lungmen Harbor"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$newhope01_intro",
            "key": "$newhope01_loop",
            "volume": 0.6,
            "crossfade": 1.5,
            "delay": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "background",
        "params": {
            "image": "bg_corridor",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "screenadapt": "coverall"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "I teamed up with Rhodes Island to clear out the Reunion forces that were blocking your way. Your squad is pretty much fine as well. Heheh~ You can finally go back to Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Just when you thought that everything had settled down, you took a blast head-on and got knocked out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "...Really?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Are you asking if you really let someone sneak up on you like that, or if you really managed to get hit with explosives but only end up unconscious?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Forget it, stop pulling my leg. What's the situation in Lungmen now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "It's a terrible mess. Read the report yourself if you'd like."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Regardless of what happened before, the fact is that our counterattack has been significantly set back because of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Right now, the Special Ops Division should be assembling the remainder of your squad, then joining up with the rest of the L.G.D. along with Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "So we'll be fighting our way straight to the heart of the city. Maneuver warfare, huh? That does seem promising."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "What's the purpose of that kind of strategy though?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Destroying all of Reunion's rally points. We'll fully utilize the advantage you've created for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "In other words, a siege."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "That's right, we have to seize this opportunity when Reunion is still trying to establish a foothold."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "However, in doing so, we'll be forcing their remnants to converge faster."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You can't guarantee that you'll be able to hold them off until the L.G.D. is reassembled, much less ensure that the Reunion remnants are all dealt with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We don't need any of your 'advantages,' nor do I need to hear you lecture me about strategies."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "You don't have a say in the matter, Ch'en. Even if you are the head of the Special Ops Divison and enjoy a certain degree of autonomy during times of war, you cannot absolve yourself of all accountability."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Judging by your tone, you're trying to challenge me. I'll take you on, but not right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We each have our own orders. The only thing that matters is that we do our job."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Ch'en, the L.G.D. has fallen, and Reunion has taken control of the L.G.D. Headquarters. This is your fault."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Why were you not here when Lungmen needed you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Was that also an order?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "If you weren't neglecting your duties, Lungmen wouldn't have fallen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "I'm ashamed of you, Ch'en. You should resign immediately, and let me take over the Special Ops Division."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    }
